{
  "title": "Savory Cottage Cheese and Avocado Toast",
  "description": "This Savory Cottage Cheese and Avocado Toast provides 22g of protein and comes together in just 10 minutes. It features creamy whipped cottage cheese topped with fresh avocado and a soft-boiled egg on toasted sourdough. Save it for your next meal prep.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "servings": 1,
